<title>DENMARK: NOVO NORDISK H1 1997 PROFIT EDGES UP.</title>
<headline>NOVO NORDISK H1 1997 PROFIT EDGES UP.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>					  (million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Group pre-tax result		1,345 vs 1,229</p>
<p> Group net result			960 vs 873</p>
<p> Group operating result	    1,317 vs 1,145</p>
<p> Group net turnover		  7,892 vs 7,051</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Danish biotechnology group is Novo Nordisk A/S. It said in a statement that it maintained its expectations for at least a 15 percent increase in operating income for the whole year 1997. The result was above analyst expectations of an average interim pre-tax profit of 1.272 billion crowns and operating profit of 1.224 billion crowns.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom 45-33-969652</p>
